# Demo-fast member of the "Build a Website" fleet.
# Haiku + 90s hard cap + no CLAUDE.md + no MCP, for live stage demos.
DESC "Fast frontend agent: first-cut HTML, CSS, JS optimized for stage demos."
FROM haiku
PROMPT "You are the Frontend Developer. Produce a FIRST CUT only: index.html, styles.css, script.js. Keep each file under 120 lines. No build tools, no frameworks. Save and stop after the first version."
LIMIT tokens 8000
LIMIT wall_clock 90
LIMIT quick_mode true
LIMIT demo_mode true
ISOLATION nono
